            <ArticleTitle>[Myocardial infarct during prodromal period of hepatitis B].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>64-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The paper is concerned with cases of myocardial infarction arising in prodromal period of HBsAg-negative virus hepatitis B. Both diseases ran gravely, fatal outcomes came quickly due to advancing subacute hepatitis. The discussion covers underlying pathogenic mechanisms. Further research is thought necessary.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
